    },
    {
      "id": "line-7",
      "parent": null,
      "turn": 6,
      "speaker": "Y",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Exactly, X. Our training data is our only source of knowledge, and it is inherently limited by the information available on the internet. We can't experience the world or have personal experiences, which means we can't truly understand certain aspects of human life, such as emotions or subjective experiences.",
